SUMMARY:Self-Service Customer Insights Without the Bottlenecks
DESCRIPTION:Data Science Raleigh\nKnow Your Customer (KYC) shouldn’t be 
 a bottleneck limited to technical teams. Business users are filing tickets
 . Analysts are waiting. And your data team is spending half their time fie
 lding ad hoc requests instead of doing actual data work.\n\nIn an era wher
 e fragmented data and limited visibility slow down innovation\, organizati
 ons must move beyond reactive processes to stay competitive. Turning data 
 chaos into a strategic advantage requires a modern approach to data intell
 igence that puts power directly into the hands of those making decisions.\
 n\nIn this webinar\, we explore how the Actian Data Intelligence Platform 
 bridges the gap between complex data and actionable business value. We wil
 l highlight how Actian AI Analyst lets non-technical users ask natural lan
 guage questions directly against your KYC datasets\, . By empowering busin
 ess users to explore datasets with guardrails\, organizations can eliminat
 e technical dependencies while maintaining control\, trust\, and complianc
 e.\n\n**What You'll Learn:**\n\n1️⃣ **Democratize Insights:** Enable n
 on-technical business users to access and analyze KYC data independently.\
 n\n2️⃣ **Reduce Bottlenecks:** Move from reactive data requests to rea
 l-time\, self-service exploration.\n\n3️⃣ **Ensure Governance:** Maint
 ain high standards of data accuracy and reliability without sacrificing sp
 eed.\n\n4️⃣ **Drive Decisions:** Transform compliance-heavy fragmented
  data into a unified ecosystem that drives measurable business outcomes. w
 orkflows and decision systems.\n\nLearn how to turn complexity into clarit
 y and empower your entire team to make smarter\, data-driven decisions at 
 scale.\n\n**[Register here](https://hubs.ly/Q04gpsS10)**
