SUMMARY:Fueling the Future: The Strategic Role of Synthetic Data in AI Wor
 kflows
DESCRIPTION:Data Science Raleigh\nIn the race to production-ready AI\, dat
 a remains the primary bottleneck. But synthetic data is changing the game
 —providing a powerful lever for accelerating development\, increasing ro
 bustness\, and ensuring AI systems are ready for the edge cases real data 
 won’t always cover.\n\nThis session explores the evolving role of synthe
 tic data as a strategic tool in modern AI workflows. From model training a
 nd stress testing to privacy-preserving simulations and continuous tuning\
 , we’ll examine where synthetic data adds the most value—and how to in
 tegrate it into your stack without compromising trust or traceability.\n\n
 **What You'll Learn:**\n\n1️⃣ **Beyond Augmentation:** Where synthetic
  data outperforms traditional augmentation—and when to use which.\n\n2
 ️⃣ **Safe\, Scalable Testing:** How to stress-test models in controlle
 d environments without risking exposure to sensitive or limited real-world
  data.\n\n3️⃣ **Tuning for the Unknown:** Using synthetic scenarios to
  identify edge cases\, reduce brittleness\, and prepare models for real-wo
 rld variability.\n\n4️⃣ **Governance & Validation:** Ensuring syntheti
 c data aligns with quality\, compliance\, and auditability requirements.\n
 \n**[Register here](https://hubs.ly/Q04blrbG0)**
